    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5a6e5b541655b1aeece1236ea76d8b8de068511b744f847aeb7d3535cf9229b7",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n前进，前进，前进，右转……\n同样的四张卡，还要再排？\n用一张重复卡：重复四次！\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
